 REASONS  8. Addl. Issue No.2:-
After amendment of the written statement, the defendant has inserted paragraph 6(a) and 6(b),
wherein he took up a defense that this court has no jurisdiction to try this suit, since the total measurement of suit schedule premises is 11.14836 sq.mtrs, which is less than 14 sq.mtrs, hence prayed to dismiss the suit.
